@startuml
!theme toy
title 04 - Services Ownership & Dataflow (component)

left to right direction

component "Application\n(owns platform/services/Renderer)" as App #77DD77
component "ApplicationEditor\n(owns player/camera/viewport/input/UI/pass)" as Editor #77DD77
component "ServicesStore\n(FlatMap type_index -> safe_ptr)" as Store #CF9FFF
component "IShaderService\n(ROW_MAJOR session)" as ShaderSvc #CF9FFF
component "IRhiService\n(device via global session)" as RhiSvc #CF9FFF
component "SharedContext\n(m_lifecycle + requestExit)" as Ctx #FF6961
component "ScratchPad/Allocators\n(per-frame transient)" as Scratch #FDFD96
component "RawChannel/Signal\n(MPSC + select)" as Chan #FFB347
component "TrianglePass\n(owns shaders/pipelines/caches)" as Pass #77DD77
component "Renderer\n(surfaces + queue + present)" as Renderer #77DD77
component "Window\n(present target)" as Window #FFB347

App --> Store : owns
Editor --> Store : resolves
Store --> ShaderSvc : holds
Store --> RhiSvc : holds
App --> Ctx : lifecycle
App --> Renderer : owns
Editor --> Pass : owns
Renderer --> Scratch : per-frame renderDraws_
App --> Chan : async IO events
Editor --> Chan : input events

ShaderSvc --> RhiSvc : global session
RhiSvc --> Pass : device + program
Pass --> Renderer : draw submissions
Renderer --> Window : present

note right of ShaderSvc : Shader.cpp:182 ROW_MAJOR\nsession feeds RHI
note right of RhiSvc : RHI.cppm:166 IRhiService\ndevice creation

legend
<font color="#77DD77">■</font> app / services / processing
<font color="#CF9FFF">■</font> shared libs / services
<font color="#FDFD96">■</font> data stores / transient memory
<font color="#FFB347">■</font> external / infra
<font color="#FF6961">■</font> errors / critical lifecycle
endlegend

